Name: STATS DOE ANALYSIS
Display-Name: Design of Experiments Analysis
Dialog-Specs: STATS_DOE_ANALYSIS.cfe
Command-Specs: STATS_DOE_ANALYSIS.xml
Code-Files: STATS_DOE_ANALYSIS.R
Misc-Files: extsyntax.css,IBMdialogicon.png,markdown.html
Summary: Generate and analyze experimental designs
Description: Generates experimental designs (optimal, factorial, Placket
 t-Burman, response surface, Box-Behnken, CCD, Taguchi, Latin hypercube,
  definitive screening, mixtures) and analyzes the results: coded-factor
  models, ANOVA, multi-response optimization, and an interactive Model a
 nd Optimizer Lab in the HTML report. Variables are dragged from the sou
 rce list.
Author: JKP, IBM SPSS
Version: 3.1.0
Product-Version: 18
Date: 20-oct-2026
Categories: experimental design
Plugins: R
R-Packages: AlgDesign,jsonlite
